0329-negroni-wlan-wpa2-psk: Wi-Fi, WPA2-PSK in the kernel (4-way + group handshake, CCMP keys by WMI).
negroni_wlan_wpa_crypto.{c,h}: HakiOS wifi/lx/src/lx_wpa.{c,h} (MIT, notice kept; commit a52a4c9d) - SHA-1, HMAC,
PBKDF2 PMK, PRF PTK, MIC, AES key unwrap, message 2/4/group replies; host test of the port: HakiOS tools/wpa-test,
195 checks, 0 failed (ASan/UBSan). negroni_wlan_wpa.c: passphrase (8..63 printable) or 64-hex PMK, read_random
nonce, our RSN element (CCMP/CCMP/PSK, no MFP), EAPOL from the data path queued and handled at the top level,
message 4 out before WMI_VDEV_INSTALL_KEY pairwise + group (RSC), INSTALL_KEY_COMPLETE checked, then PEER AUTHORIZE ->
CONNECTED; group rekey; 10 s time-out / bad MIC -> link down (reason 15). No key bytes logged. negroni_wlan_join.c:
stop when the AP's group cipher is not CCMP. Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0329".

